
# Mutation testing: instrumented sandbox + its report
.stryker-tmp
evals/.traces/
evals/.work/
evals/.drift/
reports
src/__eval__/
src/__verify__/

# Derived from registry/, which is what git carries: one file per component, so a
# branch that adds a component does not rewrite a 171KB file that every other
# branch also touched. Every tool still reads this one; `npm run gen-registry`
# writes it, predev/prebuild run that, and `gen-registry:check` rebuilds it when a
# fresh checkout has not.
component-registry.json

# Scratch output of the design-sync tooling: proposals, not decisions. A
# proposal that git carries reads as part of the system, and this one was
# swept into a commit by `git add -A` and published before anyone read it.
.ds/
